    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T17:38:12Z",
    "body": "It looks like Chrome also blocks requests for other permissions from opaque origins, but there is no mention of this in the Permissions specification. I think we probably want to move the `reject_opaque_origin.html` test out of Web Platform Tests.",
